From: Artem Bambalov <artembambalov1993@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] DIAGNOSTIC: c2allocatorgralloc: say what was asked for and
 what came back

TEMPORARY. Remove once the thumbnail layout question is settled.

Software video decode into a gralloc buffer produces a picture whose rows
are offset in steps, with zeroed -- and therefore green -- regions where no
data landed. The usage the codec asks for is right, and the conversion to
gralloc usage is right, so the disagreement is between what gralloc
allocated and what Codec2 believes it allocated. Neither number is
observable from the device: IAllocator does not implement dumpDebugInfo and
the buffers live for a fraction of a second.

Two lines, then. The first is upstream's own, only behind a commented-out
LOG_NDEBUG, and it is extended with the geometry and the stride the
allocator returned. The second prints the layout lockYCbCr hands back for a
YCBCR_420_888 buffer -- the strides, the chroma step, and the distance
between the three plane pointers, which is what says whether the planes sit
where Codec2 assumes they do.

---
diff --git a/media/codec2/vndk/C2AllocatorGralloc.cpp b/media/codec2/vndk/C2AllocatorGralloc.cpp
index af97e61fc..f61068863 100644
--- a/media/codec2/vndk/C2AllocatorGralloc.cpp
+++ b/media/codec2/vndk/C2AllocatorGralloc.cpp
@@ -752,6 +752,13 @@ c2_status_t C2AllocationGralloc::map(
                 ALOGD("lockYCbCr failed: %d", err);
                 return err;
             }
+            ALOGD("mocha: lockYCbCr gave yStride=%u cStride=%u chromaStep=%u"
+                  " y=%p cb=%p cr=%p (cb-y=%zd cr-cb=%zd) for %ux%u",
+                  ycbcrLayout.yStride, ycbcrLayout.cStride, ycbcrLayout.chromaStep,
+                  ycbcrLayout.y, ycbcrLayout.cb, ycbcrLayout.cr,
+                  (ssize_t)((uint8_t *)ycbcrLayout.cb - (uint8_t *)ycbcrLayout.y),
+                  (ssize_t)((uint8_t *)ycbcrLayout.cr - (uint8_t *)ycbcrLayout.cb),
+                  rect.width, rect.height);
             addr[C2PlanarLayout::PLANE_Y] = (uint8_t *)ycbcrLayout.y;
             addr[C2PlanarLayout::PLANE_U] = (uint8_t *)ycbcrLayout.cb;
             addr[C2PlanarLayout::PLANE_V] = (uint8_t *)ycbcrLayout.cr;
@@ -991,6 +998,8 @@ c2_status_t C2AllocatorGralloc::Impl::newGraphicAllocation(
         if (err != C2_OK) {
             return err;
         }
+        ALOGD("mocha: allocated %ux%u format %#x usage %#llx -> stride %u",
+              width, height, format, (long long)grallocUsage, info.stride);
         allocation->reset(new C2AllocationGralloc(
                 info, mMapper2, buffer,
                 C2HandleGralloc::WrapAndMoveNativeHandle(
